%% Marquee drag preview then terminal selection commit sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User pointer
  participant Surface as CanvasSurface
  participant Tools as CanvasToolPort
  participant IE as InteractionEngine
  participant Cleanup as PointerToolCleanupCoordinator
  participant ReadPort as InteractionReadPort
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant SelectionFacts as SelectionFactsPort
  participant Selection as SelectionKernel
  participant Spatial as SpatialKernel
  participant Preview as CanvasPreviewState
  participant Frame as FrameEngine
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Effects as CommitEffects
  participant Applier as CommitApplier
  participant Events as EventBuffer
  participant Runtime as RuntimeRoot
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  User->>Surface: pointer down in move mode
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample down)
  Tools->>IE: normalized finite down sample
  IE->>IE: admit one active pointer token
  IE->>ReadPort: read marquee start selection facts
  ReadPort->>SelectionFacts: read selected ids and selectionRevision
  SelectionFacts-->>ReadPort: selected ids
  ReadPort->>Store: read document order for selected ids
  Store-->>ReadPort: previous selection in document order
  ReadPort-->>IE: previous selection in document order
  IE->>ReadPort: read selected-move start facts for down position
  ReadPort->>Spatial: hit-test down position once
  Spatial-->>ReadPort: top visible selectable element id or none
  ReadPort-->>IE: selected ids, movable ids, and hit-selected fact

  alt down is admitted for selected move
    IE-->>Tools: route to selected move behavior
  else down is admitted for marquee
    IE->>ReadPort: read marquee start selection facts
    ReadPort->>SelectionFacts: read selected ids and selectionRevision
    SelectionFacts-->>ReadPort: selected ids
    ReadPort->>Store: read document order for selected ids
    Store-->>ReadPort: previous selection in document order
    ReadPort-->>IE: previous selection in document order
    IE->>IE: start marquee session with anchor position
    Note over IE: Session stores pointer token, sessionId, anchor position, and previous selection.
    IE->>Preview: publish CanvasMarqueePreview(rect: zero-area rect)
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay rectangle preview
  end

  loop pointer move samples for same token
    User->>Surface: pointer move
    Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample move)
    Tools->>IE: normalized finite move sample
    IE->>IE: normalize rectangle from anchor to current position
    Note over IE,Frame: Marquee drag preview is overlay-only and no selected-move main-scene preview delta is staged.
    IE->>Preview: replace immutable CanvasMarqueePreview(rect)
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint only
    Frame->>Preview: capture previewRevision and CanvasMarqueePreview.rect once
    Frame->>Frame: build marquee fill and stroke overlay primitives
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay rectangle preview
  end

  User->>Surface: pointer up
  Surface->>Tools: handlePointer(CanvasPointerSample up)
  Tools->>IE: same-token terminal sample
  IE->>IE: normalize terminal marquee rectangle
  IE->>ReadPort: read marquee commit facts for normalized rect
  alt zero-area rect from point click
    ReadPort->>Spatial: query bounded point hit window
    Spatial-->>ReadPort: visible selectable point-hit candidate handles
    ReadPort->>ReadPort: resolve immutable candidates and choose topmost exact hit
  else non-zero marquee rect
    ReadPort->>Spatial: query hitBounds overlapping marquee rect
    Spatial-->>ReadPort: visible selectable candidate handles
    ReadPort->>ReadPort: run exact family inclusion test and order selected ids by document order
  end
  ReadPort-->>IE: previous ids, next ids, rect, and query facts

  alt next selection equals previous selection
    IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for marquee session
      Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
      IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear marquee session
    IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
    Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
    Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
    Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
    Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint request
    Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without marquee
    Note over EK,Events: No EditKernel commit, no Store mutation, no selection revision, and no selectMarquee action.
    IE-->>Tools: terminal handling complete
  else marquee selection changed
    IE-->>Runtime: return MarqueeCommitIntent
    Runtime->>EK: prepare interaction CommitPlan.replaceSelection
    EK->>EK: reject disposed, nested edit, or resolver callback mutation
    Runtime->>Events: stage selectMarquee action descriptor in CommitPlan
    Runtime->>Touched: record selectionChanged only
    Note over Events: type selectMarquee. elementIds are next selection in document order. payload CanvasSelectionActionPayload(previousSelection, nextSelection, marqueeRectWorld).
    alt commit preflight and install succeed
      EK->>Applier: apply prepared selection CommitPlan
      Applier->>Selection: install selection effect atomically
      Selection->>Selection: replace selected ids and selectionRevision
      Note over Applier,Selection: Atomic install is the commit boundary.
      Note over Selection,Spatial: Selection changes do not update spatial indexes or projection cache.
      Selection-->>Applier: committed selection revision facts
      Applier-->>Runtime: committed selection facts and staged action intents
      Runtime->>IE: finishMarquee(postSuccessCommit)
      IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for marquee session
      Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
      IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear marquee session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish one CanvasRuntimeState with selection and preview effects
      Events->>Signals: publish selectMarquee action notification
      Frame->>Signals: publish committed main repaint and overlay cleanup repaint notifications
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint main scene selection and overlay without marquee
      IE-->>Tools: terminal handling complete
    else edit exception, rejected Future, or preflight failure
      EK->>Events: discard pending selectMarquee action
      EK-->>Runtime: terminal failure
      Runtime->>IE: finishMarquee(editFailure)
      IE->>Cleanup: typed cleanup request for marquee session
      Cleanup-->>IE: PointerCleanupOutcome(overlay repaint target, preview changed)
      IE->>Preview: apply outcome: publish CanvasNoPreview and clear marquee session
      IE->>Preview: bump previewRevision for cleared active preview
      Preview-->>Runtime: preview cleanup revision fact
      Runtime->>Signals: publish CanvasRuntimeState with updated state.revisions.preview
      Preview->>Frame: request overlay repaint cleanup
      Frame->>Signals: publish overlay cleanup repaint notification
      Signals-->>Surface: repaint overlay without marquee
      Note over Selection,Signals: Rollback keeps selection state, document state, main repaint, and selectMarquee action unchanged.
      Note over Runtime,Signals: Active preview cleanup publishes only preview state.
    end
  end
